 "text": "Radar engineer Percy Spencer recalled a candy bar melting in his pocket near a magnetron. Retelling's changed the snack. The documented record is his 1945 patent. It sends magnetron microwaves down a guide to food on a conveyor. His test, an egg hard -boiled with two units of energy instead of 36. Lesson, when something odd happens, test it and measure it. Download RM to support livelihood tools."
